WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.667
The turning tip tests the front and middle discs before it reaches the loaded rear rim.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.208
The rear gate clears. The sidebar now rests on the middle rim.

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:07.417
The rear and middle gates are ready. The front rim alone holds the bar out.

00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:08.250
The sidebar enters the shallow notch. Its outer edge still reaches between the brass walls.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.875
Pressure eases. The sidebar has room to move out while the front disc turns.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:11.958
The deep front gate lets the sidebar drop clear of the housing.

00:00:11.958 --> 00:00:12.500
The seated bar and all three discs turn together.
